WEBVTT

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.660
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.990
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:22.570
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world

00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:26.200
and spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:31.370
The Black Edge encounters
the sorcerer Malduk on the Galluah Plains.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:37.490
They fight valiantly,
but one by one, are slain by Malduk.

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:40.490
In the end, the Black Edge are annihilated.

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.370
Check for survivors.

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:48.910
Yes!

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:54.240
Riheet!

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:56.700
Hold it together! Riheet!

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:02.070
<i>When the red-stained night comes</i>

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:07.280
<i>I paint you on the sky</i>

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:17.570
"KING's RAID:
Successors of the Will"

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:22.160
<i>The hidden truth</i>

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:26.700
<i>The sudden suffocation</i>

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:31.950
<i>You are so distant, fading</i>

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:36.620
<i>Do you feel it too?</i>

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:38.950
<i>Crossing blades</i>

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:41.780
<i>Cannot touch</i>

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:46.410
<i>The sadness that lies beyond</i>

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:48.910
<i>I just want to see you</i>

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:52.870
<i>I search for you</i>

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:56.320
<i>Now, Eclipse</i>

00:01:56.320 --> 00:02:01.200
<i>I always want to be by your side</i>

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:03.870
<i>I send a wish to the sky</i>

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:06.070
<i>I believe in destiny</i>

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:08.490
<i>When the sun and moon meet</i>

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:10.950
<i>At that moment</i>

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:14.160
<i>I run to you</i>

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:18.030
<i>With all my heart</i>

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:31.920
<i></i>Scars

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:31.920
<i></i>of Loss

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:40.160
We had vegetables grown in
the village for breakfast.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:44.120
We cannot thank you enough
for the food and your help.

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:47.410
Allow me to express
gratitude as well. Thank you.

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:50.990
I-It's an honor, Princess Scarlett!

00:02:50.990 --> 00:02:53.990
The villagers will be pleased.

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:57.120
So how is Mr. Riheet doing?

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:59.910
He still hasn't regained consciousness.

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:01.910
I see...

00:03:07.530 --> 00:03:09.620
It's good you were able to
provide a place to lie him down.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:12.370
We can concentrate on healing him.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:15.450
Yes. We cannot thank you enough.

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:18.120
We must help each other in times of need.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:22.570
Besides, we owe the people of Orvelia a favor.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:27.780
Just the other day,
a traveler from Orvelia saved us.

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:33.530
They took care of our children,
and even took down a Demon for us.

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:34.700
A traveler?

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:37.910
Yes, a young man named Kasel.

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:44.280
I believe Kasel was the name of
a younger friend of Clause.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:47.120
However, he should still be an apprentice.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.870
What is he doing out here?

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:53.120
I don't know what the circumstances were...

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.030
But it's good to know that,
even where we aren't aware,

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:59.740
we have allies fighting against the Demons.

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:02.240
Yes, indeed.

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:04.990
The Orvelian princess is so pretty!

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:07.070
Yeah. She's awesome!

00:04:07.070 --> 00:04:10.570
When I passed by her, she smelled so nice!

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:13.740
You girls, come over here and help!

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:15.410
Yes!

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:18.780
Please excuse me.

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:20.160
Yes.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:27.700
I wonder why Riheet won't wake up.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:32.320
I don't know. But when
he does regain consciousness...

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:36.950
...we'll have to tell him about how
the Black Edge were wiped out.

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:39.160
Yes...

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:42.410
Should I speak with him?

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:45.320
No, this is my duty.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:48.160
I hope he takes it calmly...

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:55.160
How is he?

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.660
Unfortunately, I can't say...

00:04:57.660 --> 00:05:02.280
I can't figure out why he won't
regain consciousness.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.620
Seems like this could take a while longer.

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:05.950
Yes...

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:09.160
Your Highness, though I share
your concern about Riheet,

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:12.410
we cannot stay here for too long.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:17.660
Perhaps we should leave just one soldier behind,
and the rest of us should return to Orvelia.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:21.570
We know now that there are
Demons on the Galluah Plains.

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:25.120
We should act, assuming the worst.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:28.910
We must return to Orvelia, immediately.

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:32.280
I understand. But...

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:36.490
Only Riheet knows what kind of
Demons he fought.

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:40.740
It would be too dangerous to take action
before getting information from Riheet.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:43.410
That's true, but...

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:46.620
I'm anxious, too.

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:50.700
But we cannot lose any more lives.

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:03.740
Good morning, Princess Scarlett!

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:06.660
Yes, good morning.

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:08.700
We picked some flowers.

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.490
Please enjoy!

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:19.120
Thank you.

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:21.870
Girls, what are you doing?

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:23.200
Dad.

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:25.950
Elise, go play over there.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:26.900
Yeah!

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:29.990
See you later, Princess Scarlett!

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.570
You're right, she does smell nice!

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:33.490
Right?

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:35.740
The children are cheerful.

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:36.910
Yes.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:40.740
Even at a time like this,
as long as the children are happy,

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:43.870
we adults can carry on.

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:48.450
I see... The village chief
told us what happened.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:50.740
You all went through a lot.

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:56.530
Yes... I made my daughter Elise
go through a terrible experience.

00:06:56.530 --> 00:07:00.160
But I am the one that got cheered up by her...

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:05.990
As feeble as that sounds, the strength
these children have truly surprises me.

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:09.030
One day soon, I'd like to leave
this village with Elise

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.910
and go back to a normal life.

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:16.740
I only wish the Demons would go away
and give us back a safe life...

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:19.780
That's what we're here for.

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:23.660
For everyone's sake,
we will destroy the Demons.

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:27.030
Reporting!

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:29.450
Demons have appeared on the Galluah Plains.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:32.370
The Black Edge, serving as the vanguard...

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:34.120
Have been annihilated...

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:39.410
That's impossible. There must be a mistake.

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:41.820
Is Princess Scarlett safe?!

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:46.410
Yes, she left Galluah Plains with Lady Demia.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:55.320
There is no way Riheet would lose to a Demon!

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:58.620
Come back with some real information, idiot!

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:03.740
The Black Edge were wiped out?!

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:06.240
They say only Riheet survived.

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:10.160
The rumors have spread to
the townsfolk. Everyone's rattled.

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:14.870
We can't be rattled with them.

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:16.240
Yeah...

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:18.740
The Black Edge lost to the Demons...?

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:21.070
Yeah, I can't believe it either...

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:24.120
It must have been a terribly strong Demon!

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:28.410
What would happen to Orvelia
if such a terrible Demon attacked?

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:30.870
Is Mr. Azal all right...?

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:32.160
No...

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:33.820
Sheila...

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:37.070
Tamm... What about Tamm?!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.660
I heard they were wiped out...

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:44.990
No...

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:05.910
There's nothing more we can do
but wait until he regains consciousness.

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:11.280
Riheet.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.660
You're awake!

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:19.820
Riheet, are you all right?

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:21.950
Where am I...?

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:24.570
Where are the others?

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:29.030
I will speak with him. Can you leave us?

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:30.780
Understood.

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:40.160
When we arrived,

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:45.070
you were all down on the ground,
and the Demons were gone.

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:49.990
Riheet, you were the only survivor.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.950
I'm truly sorry...

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:56.700
I see.

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:02.780
Can you... give me some time alone?

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.240
Understood.

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:12.820
Your Highness, is Riheet...?

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:19.660
I think he's in shock...
But I believe he will recover.

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:24.740
Let's wait a while before
asking him about the Demons.

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:28.280
When he calms down,
please get him something to eat.

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:29.570
Yes.

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:49.490
Riheet is missing?!

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:52.160
Yes, I can't find him anywhere!

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:54.530
Where could he have gone...?

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:57.570
In his state, there's no way
he could have gotten far.

00:10:57.570 --> 00:10:59.570
Let's search the surrounding area!

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:00.950
Yes!

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:08.120
Why am I alive...?

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:11.240
Why only me...?!

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:37.070
I will kill him... with my own hands...!

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:38.990
Riheet!

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:42.870
What are you doing?!
You're in no state to move around!

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:48.280
Wait, what are you trying to do?

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:53.030
If you're trying to go to Galluah Plains, don't.

00:12:53.030 --> 00:12:55.030
You're only asking to get yourself killed!

00:12:57.530 --> 00:13:00.700
That won't make your friends come back.

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:03.620
You won't even be able to avenge them!

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:05.240
Don't die, Riheet...

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:09.160
You know better than anyone
how valuable a life is...!

00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:21.780
The value of life?

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:28.070
Who took innocent lives
and tormented us? It's Orvelia!

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:30.870
Oh, kind princess...

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:38.280
You pretend to understand, yet know nothing.

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:42.570
You've never had a loved one
murdered before your eyes.

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:46.700
You've never been treated like a pest.

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:48.660
What are you talking about...?

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:54.870
We were a gathering of those
whose families were killed by Orvelia.

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:58.570
No...! There must've been a mistake!

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:03.950
There was no mistake! We were massacred!

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:09.490
Our mothers, fathers, siblings!

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:15.700
Our hometowns were burned to the ground.
We didn't have homes to return to!

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:20.160
We hated Orvelia far more
than we hated the Demons!

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:26.410
If you killed me, would that
make you feel better?

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:32.450
Why...? Why have you fought
for Orvelia this whole time?

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:37.870
To become a hero. Of course, on the surface.

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:44.160
We wanted to oppress the oppressor
and take over the kingdom.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:47.370
That was your plan all along...?

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:49.530
You were going to deceive

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:52.570
not just us royals and nobles,
but innocent citizens as well?

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:58.530
Yes, indeed. Forcing pain on the innocent--
I guess we have that in common, right?

00:14:58.530 --> 00:15:03.990
But none of that matters anymore...

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:09.450
I will find the Demon that killed
my friends, and I will end him!

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:13.410
Riheet?

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:16.200
Riheet!

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:24.820
How reckless of him.

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:29.990
What's wrong, Your Highness?

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:33.660
What have I been doing this whole time?

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:41.700
The things happening around Orvelia,
the knights I call my companions...

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:44.030
I was blind to everything.

00:15:44.030 --> 00:15:48.410
As supreme commander, I'm ashamed.

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:54.200
I thought, by joining the knights and training,
I could protect our citizens.

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:59.410
Yet, I haven't removed the Demonic threat,

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:02.740
nor have I stopped the fighting between humans.

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:07.410
Your Highness... what did
you discuss with Riheet?

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:12.030
This has nothing to do with him.
These are just my own thoughts.

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:15.450
Your Highness, you are doing
your absolute best for your citizens.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:18.410
Isn't that enough?

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.410
I'm going to get some fresh air.

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:45.370
You wouldn't understand.

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:48.320
You can never understand us.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.160
What is it?

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.570
Here.

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:02.410
This will cheer you up.

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:07.570
Thank you, but I'm fine.

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:10.070
No... You're crying.

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:15.370
You can tell?

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:18.620
Come. Let's eat together.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:21.990
Your name is... Elise, right?

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:23.240
Yes.

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:26.120
A snack made of flowers. How pretty...

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:32.910
Delicious. Did you make these?

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:39.410
Yes. When I was crying, Frey taught me how.

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:43.780
Frey...? That must be
the priestess Clause mentioned.

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:50.070
Frey stayed with me, until I stopped crying.

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:51.490
She is kind.

00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:52.700
Yes.

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:58.530
And she's strong.
She fought a Demon with Kasel.

00:17:58.530 --> 00:18:04.700
That's why I thought,
I can't cry, I have to be strong.

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:11.370
Be strong...

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:14.870
Yes, I'd like that, too.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.030
Dammit...

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:16.070
Looks like you regained consciousness.
How are you doing?

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:28.780
You've recovered so much already?

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:32.030
My magic is still supposed to be active.

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:36.870
Why did you let me live...?!

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:44.990
Answer me! Why?!

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:50.410
The pendant you're wearing...
Where did you get it?

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:53.410
Why should I answer you?!

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:58.780
Looks like you don't know what that thing is.

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:01.740
What do you mean?

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:04.160
That belonged to Illya.

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:09.410
As a Dark Elf, I'm sure you're
aware of the story.

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:15.120
The story of Illya, who was accused
and found guilty of defiling

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:19.070
Lua, the Goddess of Light,
for her research in Technomagic.

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:24.410
Illya...? That's impossible!

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:26.240
This is...

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:36.990
One hundred years ago, after Illya died,

00:20:36.990 --> 00:20:41.530
I handed the pendant to her family.

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:46.950
Since you have it,
perhaps you are her descendant.

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:52.780
Impossible...! Who is Illya to you?!

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:55.660
A best friend.

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:58.820
Illya was a benevolent woman.

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:06.450
Lies! Illya drove the Dark Elves
to exile by pursuing her dark curiosities!

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:12.450
You hate Orvelia, yet you believe
Orvelian lies? How funny.

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:20.870
She created the second Holy Sword,
the False Sword, not to defy Lua.

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:22.990
She did it to save Kyle.

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:30.990
Go to the Tower of the Sage.
Illya's lab was there.

00:21:30.990 --> 00:21:34.490
The False Sword that she left behind
should be there, too.

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:39.700
Why are you telling me this...?

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:42.660
To get back something precious.

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:45.240
Why would I believe you?

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:47.570
I don't care what you believe.

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:54.160
But you deserve to know the truth,
especially if you hate Illya.

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:57.950
That girl who was on the ground near you...

00:21:57.950 --> 00:22:00.030
She looked just like Illya.

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:12.370
The False Sword...
If I can get my hands on it...

00:22:16.570 --> 00:22:19.320
<i>This one wish</i>

00:22:19.320 --> 00:22:22.030
<i>Connects you and me</i>

00:22:22.030 --> 00:22:24.820
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:28.870
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:22:40.280 --> 00:22:45.410
<i>A comfortable breeze passes over</i>

00:22:45.410 --> 00:22:51.320
<i>A memory in a precious place</i>

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:55.950
<i>From the day I decided to walk with you</i>

00:22:55.950 --> 00:23:02.620
<i>The promise that I hid in my heart</i>

00:23:02.620 --> 00:23:08.070
<i>I want to feel that moment, just once</i>

00:23:08.070 --> 00:23:10.370
<i>If I stretch my arm out</i>

00:23:10.370 --> 00:23:13.740
<i>I should be able to reach</i>
<i>the tomorrow in my dream</i>

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:16.410
<i>This one wish</i>

00:23:16.410 --> 00:23:19.280
<i>I gently engrave in my heart</i>

00:23:19.280 --> 00:23:22.030
<i>The chain that connects the heart</i>

00:23:22.030 --> 00:23:24.820
<i>Cannot ever be broken</i>

00:23:24.820 --> 00:23:27.620
<i>The future which we should head to</i>

00:23:27.620 --> 00:23:30.410
<i>Beckons us to come closer</i>

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:33.240
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:36.200
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:23:46.820 --> 00:23:49.780
We encounter the Undead.

00:23:49.780 --> 00:23:53.570
That night, Roi tells Kasel about his past.

00:23:53.570 --> 00:23:58.450
His past life as a mercenary,
and the scars that he carries.

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:00.960
<i></i>A Night of

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:00.960
<i></i>Reminiscing

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:00.740
Hearing this, Kasel reacts...
